#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# greater

#% text
# `greater(a, b)`, written `a > b`, compares two real values; it stays symbolic when the order cannot be decided.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
5 > 2
#% output
#= true

#% cell
e > 2.718281
#% output
#= true

#% cell
x > 0
#% output
#= x > 0

#% subsection
# Scope

#% text
# Inequalities in `reduce`:

#% cell
reduce(x^2 > 4, x, reals)
#% output
#= x < -2 or 2 < x

#% section
# See also

#% text
# `less`, `greater_equal`, `max`
